# 12-second native Wayland demo: record 30 frames at 400 ms per frame.
# All actions pass through Browser::event/Browser::key using Linux key codes.
# Start from about:welcome. No direct address/open/follow commands are used.
# Ctrl+L selects the address field; h replaces the selected address.
400 down 29
420 key 38
440 up 29
